    {
      "short": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "title": "Prove it: recap",
      "body": [
        "<ul class=\"takeaways\"><li><b>Never plaintext or fast hashes</b> → argon2id or bcrypt with a per-user salt</li><li><b>Sessions</b> → server lookup, instant revocation</li><li><b>JWTs</b> → offline checks; keep them short-lived with revocable refresh tokens</li><li><b>MFA</b> → defeats stuffing; codes can still be phished</li><li><b>Passkeys and OIDC</b> → no shared password to leak, phish or reuse</li></ul>"
      ],
